note con c1: efi 13 results and refusals, then an OFF + N past the array (trap 3).
note Printed between ==B and ==E, in order: a 600-character line written by one call (three firmware
note chunks) and its result 601; a line from OFF 5; tab and CR accepted; N 0 -> 0; ARG 1 -> 2^63 | 32;
note byte 7 and byte 127 -> 2^63 | 42 with nothing written by that call; the two lines of one call
note holding two LF. run.sh also checks that every LF of the block reached the console as CR LF.
global big uchar 700

fn main to ulong
mark 66
i = ulong 0
while lt i 600
put big i uchar add 97 rem i 26
i = add i 1
end
put big 600 10
hx efi 13 0 big 0 601
put big 5 79
put big 6 70
put big 7 70
put big 8 10
hx efi 13 0 big 5 4
put big 0 97
put big 1 9
put big 2 98
put big 3 13
put big 4 99
put big 5 10
hx efi 13 0 big 0 6
hx efi 13 0 big 0 0
hx efi 13 1 big 0 6
put big 2 7
hx efi 13 0 big 0 6
put big 2 127
hx efi 13 0 big 0 6
put big 0 49
put big 1 10
put big 2 50
put big 3 10
hx efi 13 0 big 0 4
mark 69
r = efi 13 0 big 696 5
mark 88
ret 0
end
